{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrderingSymmetry","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrderingSymmetry","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.List.Count","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic"],"declarations":21,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.wordOf_pnn_ne_wordOf_npn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.wordOf_pnn_ne_wordOf_npn","kind":"theorem","line":188,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L188-L208","doc":"**The cross-species reorderings produce different words.** With the corpus's\ndistinct interface letters, `pnn` carries one `pn` crossing and `npn` carries\ntwo, so the words are not equal.\n\nTogether with `sum_symmetrize_eq_nsmul` this is the whole finding: the group the\ncorpus's orbit identity ranges over acts trivially, while the group PR #4849\nvaried over is not a symmetry of the construction — the word genuinely\nchanges. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.count_link_pn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.count_link_pn","kind":"theorem","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L159-L186","doc":"Counting the `pn` interface letter in the word recovers the interface list's\n`pn` count, provided that letter is distinct from the other two interface\nletters and does not occur inside either intra-nucleon chain. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.ifaces_pnn_ne_ifaces_npn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.ifaces_pnn_ne_ifaces_npn","kind":"theorem","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L152-L157","doc":"The tritium orderings of PR #4849 §5.1 have **different interface lists**:\n`pnn ↦ [pn, nn]` but `npn ↦ [pn, pn]`. They are not related by any\nspecies-preserving relabelling, and no corpus identity covers them. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.sum_symmetrize_eq_nsmul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.sum_symmetrize_eq_nsmul","kind":"theorem","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L132-L148","doc":"**Orbit-symmetrization over the forced group is the identity map.**\n\nFor *any* readout `f` — scalar trace, operator norm, the transverse pairing,\nanything — summing over a finite family `G` of species-preserving relabellings\nreturns `G.card • f (word)`. Averaging over the `S_Z × S_N` orbit therefore\nchanges **nothing**: it cannot cancel a residual, and it cannot create one.\n\nThe hypothesis is the whole content: it is what fails for a cross-species\nreordering (§3). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.wordOf_of_speciesPreserving","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.wordOf_of_speciesPreserving","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L116-L130","doc":"**The word depends on the nucleon labelling only through the species\nstring.** A relabelling `σ` of nucleon indices that preserves species\n(`s (σ k) = s k` — exactly the condition defining `S_Z × S_N`) leaves the\nspecies string, hence the whole word, **literally unchanged**.\n\nThis is Lemma 1(a) of the orbit-trace identity proof. Note what it does *not*\nsay: it is not an invariance of a readout under a nontrivial transformation of\nthe word. The word never moves. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.wordOf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.wordOf","kind":"def","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L101-L112","doc":"The atomic braid word of an explicit species ordering, in the shape of\n`atom_orbit_reduction.atom_braid_word_ordered`: per nucleon its species\nintra-chain, followed by the adjacency-typed interface letter joining it to the\nnext nucleon.\n\n`intra` supplies the two species chains and `lk` the three interface letters;\nthe generator-index bookkeeping of the Python emitter is irrelevant to every\nstatement below and is omitted. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.ifaces","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.ifaces","kind":"def","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L92-L97","doc":"The interface list of an ordering — the corpus `interface_multiset`, kept\nordered. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.iface","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.iface","kind":"def","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L85-L90","doc":"`_interface_type` of `computations/atom_orbit_reduction.py`: like species give\n`pp` / `nn`, unlike species give `pn` in either order. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.instReprIface.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.instReprIface.repr","kind":"def","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L81-L81","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.instReprIface","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.instReprIface","kind":"instance","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L81-L81","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.instDecidableEqIface","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.instDecidableEqIface","kind":"instance","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L81-L81","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.Iface.nn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.Iface.nn","kind":"ctor","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L80-L80","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.Iface.pn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.Iface.pn","kind":"ctor","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L79-L79","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.Iface.pp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.Iface.pp","kind":"ctor","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L78-L78","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.Iface","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.Iface","kind":"inductive","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L76-L81","doc":"The adjacency type of a neighbouring pair — the corpus `_interface_type`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.instReprSpecies.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.instReprSpecies.repr","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L74-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.instReprSpecies","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.instReprSpecies","kind":"instance","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L74-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.instDecidableEqSpecies","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.instDecidableEqSpecies","kind":"instance","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L74-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.Species.n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.Species.n","kind":"ctor","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L73-L73","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.Species.p","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.Species.p","kind":"ctor","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L72-L72","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.Species","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.NucleonOrdering.Species","kind":"inductive","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/NucleonOrderingSymmetry.lean#L70-L74","doc":"A nucleon species. ","signatureChunk":0}]}